    <string name="faq_title">Get to know GeoDrop</string>
    <string name="faq_intro">GeoDrop is built around sharing location-based drops. Here\'s a quick overview of how everything fits together.</string>
    <string name="faq_question_core_features">What are GeoDrop\'s core features?</string>
    <string name="faq_answer_core_features">Create drops at real-world spots, explore what\'s nearby, and connect with people and places through interactive stories, offers, and updates.</string>
    <string name="faq_question_drop_contents">What can a drop include?</string>
    <string name="faq_answer_drop_contents">Drops can hold text notes, photos, voice clips, and even business rewards or coupons. Combine the pieces that best fit the moment.</string>
    <string name="faq_question_explorer_usage">How do explorers use drops?</string>
    <string name="faq_answer_explorer_usage">Explorers follow the map or notifications to visit drops, open the content, react or collect it, and save favorites for later adventures.</string>
